1
00:05:38,823 --> 00:05:44,823
One meeting. Six million lives.

2
00:11:17,647 --> 00:11:23,647
Conspiracy is a history, drama, war film directed by Frank Pierson.

3
00:16:56,470 --> 00:17:02,470
At the Wannsee Conference on January 20, 1942, senior Nazi officials meet to determine the manner in
which the so-called "Final Solution to the Jewish Question" can be best implemented.

4
00:22:35,294 --> 00:22:41,294
Reinhard Heydrich, played by Kenneth Branagh.

5
00:28:14,117 --> 00:28:20,117
Adolf Eichmann, played by Stanley Tucci.

6
00:33:52,941 --> 00:33:58,941
Dr. Wilhelm Stuckart, played by Colin Firth.

7
00:39:31,764 --> 00:39:37,764
Erich Neumann, played by Jonathan Coy.

8
00:45:10,588 --> 00:45:16,588
Heinrich Müller, played by Brendan Coyle.

9
00:50:49,411 --> 00:50:55,411
Josef Bühler, played by Ben Daniels.

10
00:56:28,235 --> 00:56:34,235
Conspiracy is a 2001 made-for-television drama film that
dramatises the 1942 Wannsee Conference.

11
01:02:07,058 --> 01:02:13,058
Using the authentic script taken from the only surviving transcript recorded during the meeting, the film delves into the
psychology of Nazi officials involved in the "Final Solution of the Jewish question" during World War II.

12
01:07:45,882 --> 01:07:51,882
The film was written by Loring Mandel and directed by Frank Pierson.

13
01:13:24,705 --> 01:13:30,705
Its ensemble cast includes Kenneth Branagh, Stanley
Tucci, Colin Firth and David Threlfall.

14
01:19:03,529 --> 01:19:09,529
Branagh won a Primetime Emmy Award for Outstanding Lead Actor, and Tucci
was awarded a Golden Globe Award for his supporting role.

15
01:24:42,352 --> 01:24:48,352
The film explores themes of berlin, germany, nazi, war
crimes, holocaust (shoah), world war ii.

16
01:30:21,176 --> 01:30:27,176
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking.
